      "content": "\"letting go of the struggle\"... you make it sound so peaceful. but that peace only comes if you aren't here to deal with it anymore, right? like, if i actually stopped fighting and just... left everything behind. is that really the only way to find that kind of quiet? to just exit the game entirely?",
